## Summary
The birth rate increase in the first half of this year has reached its highest level ever recorded. There has also been a notable rise in births among women in their 40s, indicating a positive trend in fertility.

## Key Points
- Birth rate increase is at an all-time high for the first half of the year.
- Births among women aged 40 and above have increased.
- This data reflects a significant positive shift in fertility trends.


